{"id":"7ed22bf7259dd6b3","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-interpretation.md","title":"GL Interpretation","display":"df-gl-interpretation — GL Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-interpretation","aliases":["89-df-gl-interpretation"],"display":"df-gl-interpretation — GL Interpretation","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-arithmetical]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-interpretation — GL Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cbb11883655db5cd\" href=\"?note=cbb11883655db5cd\" title=\"89-df-gl-arithmetical\">89-df-gl-arithmetical</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is an arithmetical theory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span> is an arithmetical realization, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span> is the class of realizations\nvalidating GL.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-provable sentences.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A\">\\((T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A\\)</span> 是下述定义的算术解释关系，参数为理论、实现与模态公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{arith},\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{arith},\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 分别标明解释层级与逻辑系统。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n(T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\land\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n(T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\land\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 将模态公式结构递归地翻译为算术句子，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> 翻译为\n可证明性公式；这里定义的是“该翻译在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中可证”的关系。</li>\n<li>假设只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)\\)</span>，没有预先假定\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\\)</span>，所以右侧的第一项不是循环重复。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-arithmetical","status":"resolved","id":"cbb11883655db5cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-arithmetical]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"(T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{arith},\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n(T,\\tau)\\models^{\\mathrm{arith}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)\n\\land\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{GLAr}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1457,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-285","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-interpretation]]"}],"outgoing":["cbb11883655db5cd","1f581262c09d5e34","2d52ad4f119b4a14","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}